  "text_md": "![](<b7d405094e779c1318d2e43b1fc897991989fb06_page_1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\nSPEA\n\nCareer Development Olfice\n\n# GREATER GOOD INTERNSHIP FUND APPLICATION FORM\n\nThis form must be e-mailed with all other required documents to Megan Boris (mtboris@iu.edu) no later than 5pm on Friday, April 20th, 2018. Put GREATER GOOD INTERNSHIP FUND in the subject line. Applications with incomplete information or missing documents will not be considered.\n\n# Contact Information\n\nName\n\nLocal Address  \n\nCity  \n\nPhone (  \n\nE-mail\n\nStudent ID (10-digit) #\n\n# Academic Standing  \n\nClass\n\nMajor(s)  \n\nMinor(s)  \n\n# of Credits Completed\n\nState\n\nZip\n\nDegree\n\nGraduation Date (Mo/Yr)\n\n# Reference\n\nList the name, telephone number and e-mail for the faculty member who will be writing a letter of reference for you:\n\nName\n\nPhone (\n\nE-mail\n\n# Internship Details\n\nOrganization  \n\nInternship Start date  \n\nLocation\n\nSupervisor Name  \n\nPhone (\n\nEnd date\n\nE-mail\n\nI confirm that information on this form is correct and accurate.\n\nS IGNATURE  \n\nDATE\n\n",
